Hello Hackers,

Since the Archeologist character class was obviously patterned after Indiana
Jones, it seems to me that it would only be fitting to include a wand of
magic missile (6) as part of the standard equipment... After all, perhaps
the most famous scene in all the I.J. movies is the one where he shoots that
big, impressive, sabre-wielding bad guy!

To me, the six-shooter is really a big part of the character, and it would
not upset the balance of the game much at all to include it in the standard
Archeologist equipment.

I know, it's a very minor point, but it does bug me a little.

On a completely different tack: could someone tell me how to get rid of
black puddings?
